<title>ALBANIA: Albania Q2 budget deficit swells to 7.3 bln leks.</title>
<headline>Albania Q2 budget deficit swells to 7.3 bln leks.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's first quarter budget deficit soared to 7.3 billion leks from 1.1 billion in the same quarter of last year, the Institute of Statistics said.</p>
<p>The insititute said government revenue in the second quarter covered only 63.7 percent of expenditure, far below the same quarter last year when it covered 92.6 percent.</p>
<p> GOVERNMENT BUDGET (MLN LEKS)     Q2 '96	 Q2 '95</p>
<p> Balance				  -7,270	 -1,113</p>
<p> Revenue				  12,752	 13,966</p>
<p> Expenditure			    20,022	 15,079</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
